# Files Prettier must not reformat.
#
# Prettier owns formatting for the web-side source (see eslint.config.mjs for
# the ESLint/Prettier split). Everything listed here is either generated, not
# ours, or hand-formatted for a reason.

# --- Third-party and generated ---------------------------------------------
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/lib                 # tsc output
**/package.json        # ...except the root one, un-ignored on the next line
!/package.json
sandor                 # the Python package, incl. the built labextension/
.venv                  # the uv-managed virtualenv (DESIGN.md D17)

# --- Deliberately excluded --------------------------------------------------
eslint.config.mjs      # heavily commented; Prettier collapses the comments

# Markdown documentation. Prettier reflows tables and wrapped list items, which
# turns a one-word edit in docs/DESIGN.md into a hundred-line diff and makes
# review impossible. These files are hand-formatted to a 100-column margin.
# .vscode/settings.json disables format-on-save for markdown to match.
*.md
